# The sketchbook demo fixture. Somebody else's artwork and somebody else's words, shrunk for a
# handset so the renderer can be measured against the page it is copying. Fine on the bench, not
# ours to redistribute — so the demo seeds itself only when these are present.
samples/AetherNet.Sample/AetherNet.Sample/Resources/Raw/sketchbook.json
samples/AetherNet.Sample/AetherNet.Sample/Resources/Raw/sketchbook-plates.json
